+---
+title: "Create a support ticket"
+sidebarTitle: "Create a support ticket"
+description: "Open a support request and keep the original request key so that a lost response can be reconciled safely."
+openapi: "/api-reference/public.openapi.json POST /support/tickets"
+playground: "simple"
+canonical: "https://docs.nixflex.com/api-reference/support/create"
+---
+
+Open a support request and keep the original request key so that a lost response can be reconciled safely.
+
+## Access
+
+Use a server-side organisation key or a signed-in personal bearer session. Owners, Admins and organisation keys have organisation-wide ticket access. Members can access only tickets they opened.
+
+## Request fields
+
+| Field | Requirement and meaning |
+| --- | --- |
+| `Idempotency-Key` | Required header. Choose a unique value for this change, 1–128 letters, digits or `._:-`. Keep it for recovery. |
+| `X-Nixflex-Expected-Account` | For a new personal write, required public `key_id` of the original workspace. Preserve it on retries. Organisation-key writes do not need it. |
+| `category` | Required string. Use `raise_call_limit`, `problem`, `report_abuse` or `other`. `billing` remains accepted for compatibility and displays as a problem. Fresh `call_me_back` requests return 400. |
+| `message` | Required plain text, 1–8,000 Unicode characters, at most 32,000 UTF-8 bytes. |
+| `subject` | Optional, 1–160 characters. Otherwise the first nonblank message line supplies the subject, with spaces collapsed and long titles shortened. |
+| `desired_limit`, `use_case` | Capacity only. Required desired total, integer 1–2,147,483,647. Optional nonblank reason up to 1,000 characters. If omitted, the message is the reason and must fit 1,000 characters. |
+| `reviewed_help_session_id` | Optional UUID for a personal, reviewed Help copy owned by the current person and workspace. It must be unused and unexpired. Include only approved text. |
+
+Send only the documented JSON fields. The entire body must fit within 64 KiB.
+
+## Example request
+
+```bash
+curl -X POST "https://api.nixflex.com/v1/support/tickets" \
+  -H "Authorization: Bearer $NIXFLEX_API_KEY" \
+  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+  -H "Idempotency-Key: $REQUEST_KEY" \
+  -d '{"category":"other","message":"Please check our test request"}'
+```
+
+## Response
+
+Returns HTTP 201 with the current ticket and the receipt for the original create. A capacity request does not change the call limit. A summary includes the ticket ID, subject, raw and display categories, status, current version and timestamps. `last_public_reply` is null or an author label and time. The receipt records `request_id`, `operation`, original `version` and `message_id`.
+
+```json
+{
+  "ticket": {
+    "id": "a2f03f19-70b8-4bb6-9f14-3bd3eb529c01",
+    "category": "other",
+    "display_category": "other",
+    "subject": "Please check our test request",
+    "status": "open",
+    "version": 1,
+    "created_at": "2026-11-23T10:00:00Z",
+    "updated_at": "2026-11-23T10:00:00Z",
+    "solved_at": null,
+    "last_customer_reply_at": "2026-11-23T10:00:00Z",
+    "last_staff_reply_at": null,
+    "last_public_reply": null
+  },
+  "receipt": {
+    "request_id": "df84c8f3-ac66-404f-b50c-b91bda2abeb3",
+    "operation": "create",
+    "version": 1,
+    "message_id": "56a3de9d-a9d9-4a7e-9d56-c5388706204b"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+## Errors
+
+| HTTP | Error code | What to do |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| 400 | `invalid_ticket` | Check permitted fields, value limits, headers and revision. |
+| 400 | `invalid_json` | Correct the JSON syntax. |
+| 401 | `unauthorized`, `invalid_token` | Supply a valid organisation key or refresh the personal session. |
+| 403 | `mfa_required`, `support_access_denied` | Complete personal verification or recheck current workspace access. |
+| 404 | `ticket_not_found` | An earlier ticket is no longer visible to this actor. Recheck current access. |
+| 404 | `reviewed_copy_unavailable` | Refresh the reviewed Help copy before submitting. |
+| 409 | `request_conflict` | This key was used for a different write. Reconcile the original request. |
+| 409 | `account_changed` | Discard the stale personal draft. Refresh Help in the intended workspace. |
+| 413 | `payload_too_large` | Keep the complete JSON request within 64 KiB. |
+| 415 | `unsupported_media_type` | Send application/json. |
+| 429 | `rate_limit_exceeded` | Wait for the request limit to reset. |
+| 429 | `ticket_create_limit` | Default is 10 creates per account in 24 hours. Wait before creating another. |
+| 503 | `auth_unavailable`, `support_unavailable` | Retry a read later. Reconcile any write before sending again. |
+
+## Retry
+
+On a lost response, reconcile first. A personal client can look up the original receipt. An identical authorised replay uses the original key and payload. Use a new key only for a newly reviewed action. [Ticket workflow and recovery](/guides/developer/support-tickets).
