+---
+title: "Mark a support ticket done"
+sidebarTitle: "Mark a support ticket done"
+description: "Mark a ticket solved at its current revision and keep its receipt. The customer can still reply to reopen it."
+openapi: "/api-reference/public.openapi.json POST /support/tickets/{ticket_id}/solve"
+playground: "simple"
+canonical: "https://docs.nixflex.com/api-reference/support/solve"
+---
+
+Mark a ticket solved at its current revision and keep its receipt. The customer can still reply to reopen it.
+
+## Access
+
+Use a server-side organisation key or a signed-in personal bearer session. Owners, Admins and organisation keys have organisation-wide ticket access. Members can access only tickets they opened.
+
+## Request fields
+
+| Field | Requirement and meaning |
+| --- | --- |
+| `ticket_id` | Required UUID in the path, for a visible ticket. |
+| `Idempotency-Key` | Required header. Choose a unique value for this change, 1–128 letters, digits or `._:-`. Keep it for recovery. |
+| `version` | Required JSON integer. Use the revision from the ticket you just reviewed, 1–2,147,483,647. |
+
+Send only the documented JSON fields. The entire body must fit within 64 KiB.
+
+## Example request
+
+```bash
+curl -X POST "https://api.nixflex.com/v1/support/tickets/a2f03f19-70b8-4bb6-9f14-3bd3eb529c01/solve" \
+  -H "Authorization: Bearer $NIXFLEX_API_KEY" \
+  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+  -H "Idempotency-Key: $REQUEST_KEY" \
+  -d '{"version":1}'
+```
+
+## Response
+
+Returns the ticket and the solve receipt. `message_id` is null for a solve without a message. A summary includes the ticket ID, subject, raw and display categories, status, current version and timestamps. `last_public_reply` is null or an author label and time. The receipt records `request_id`, `operation`, original `version` and `message_id`.
+
+```json
+{
+  "ticket": {
+    "id": "a2f03f19-70b8-4bb6-9f14-3bd3eb529c01",
+    "category": "other",
+    "display_category": "other",
+    "subject": "Please check our test request",
+    "status": "solved",
+    "version": 2,
+    "created_at": "2026-11-23T10:00:00Z",
+    "updated_at": "2026-11-23T10:00:00Z",
+    "solved_at": "2026-11-23T10:00:00Z",
+    "last_customer_reply_at": "2026-11-23T10:00:00Z",
+    "last_staff_reply_at": null,
+    "last_public_reply": null
+  },
+  "receipt": {
+    "request_id": "df84c8f3-ac66-404f-b50c-b91bda2abeb3",
+    "operation": "solve",
+    "version": 2,
+    "message_id": null
+  }
+}
+```
+
